# ROVEXO Design Protection Absolute v1.1 (P0 · CANONICAL FREEZE)

## Absolute

**Owner-approved design always wins.**  
**The Responsive Engine must adapt to the design. The design shall never adapt to the Responsive Engine.**

```
IF THE OWNER APPROVED IT → PROTECT IT.
DO NOT REBUILD IT. DO NOT REDESIGN IT. DO NOT DUPLICATE IT.
```

## Forbidden to modify Owner-approved design

Full Width Engine · Responsive Engine · Adaptive Engine · Theme Engine · Accessibility Engine · Future AI / Optimization / Layout Engines · CSS Overrides · Hot Fix Systems · Automated Refactors · Cursor Agents

## Canonical implementations may only receive

Bug fixes · performance · accessibility · responsive adaptations · overflow prevention · alignment fixes · security · browser compatibility

## Forbidden

Redesign · component replacement · visual/icon/colour changes · layout redesign · changing spacing tokens or Owner-approved dimensions · Balance/Wallet/Checkout v2 · hidden duplicates

## One singularity

ONE PAGE → ONE IMPLEMENTATION → ONE SSOT → ONE DESIGN → ONE RESPONSIVE ENGINE → ONE CANONICAL VERSION

## Full Width 100% means

Maximum available width · proper alignment · spacing · responsive · a11y · visibility  

**Not:** redesign 100% · resize everything · rebuild everything

## Correct flow

Approved Design → Responsive adaptation only → Approved Design preserved → Owner approves  

**Wrong:** Approved Design → Responsive Engine → Redesign

